title: AWS EC2 Instance
agents: aws
catalog: cloud/aws
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors AWS EC2 instance metrics via CloudWatch.
 It provides visibility into instance performance and health.

 Monitored metrics:

 - CPU Utilization: Percentage of allocated CPU used

 - Network In/Out: Network traffic in bytes

 - Disk Read/Write Ops: Disk I/O operations count

 - Disk Read/Write Bytes: Disk throughput

 - Status Checks: Instance and system status check results (CRIT on failure)

 - CPU Credit Balance: Available CPU credits (for burstable instances)

 Thresholds can be configured for CPU utilization, network traffic,
 disk operations, and CPU credit balance (lower bound).

discovery:
 One service is created for each EC2 instance discovered.
